//! RFC 7541 Appendix B Huffman 码的解码（QPACK 与 HPACK 共用的字符串 Huffman）。
//!
//! Table transcribed from RFC 7541 Appendix B; independently cross-checked
//! against python-hpack 4.0.0 (`huffman_constants`) and anchored by the RFC
//! C.4 vectors; goldens are never generated by this crate's own encoder or
//! decoder.
//!
//! 解码是纯函数：只做位解码与 EOS/padding 校验，不读系统时间/随机源，不做
//! 任何 HTTP 字段语义校验（空名字/空值原样返回）。

